{"3915160": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "The Things We Bury", "steam_appid": 3915160, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3915160/extras/14e14a0da80931bc26f767b583ab9fe4.avif?t=1771220444\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3915160/extras_big/14e14a0da80931bc26f767b583ab9fe4.webp?t=1771220444 width=1560 height=308 /></span><strong></strong><br><strong></strong><br><strong>Memories shape us. But when the mind breaks, who decides what’s worth remembering?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i>The Things We Bury</i>, you are a Memory Architect, diving into the fractured consciousness of a woman trapped in a coma. Her memories twist into surreal landscapes, symbolic enemies, and emotionally charged battles, and every choice you make shapes the person she remembers being.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a psychological deckbuilder where every card holds meaning, a memory, a regret, a part of who she was. Your decisions won’t just change the story. They’ll decide who she becomes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3915160/extras/4c4de4d14fb2ef1e1bc8ccf2c28a357a.avif?t=1771220444\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3915160/extras_big/4c4de4d14fb2ef1e1bc8ccf2c28a357a.webp?t=1771220444 width=1560 height=233 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3915160/extras/4eb35834743a6a0db6f1db155967acd9.webp?t=1771220444\" width=10 height=10 /></span> An emotional story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3915160/extras/4eb35834743a6a0db6f1db155967acd9.webp?t=1771220444\" width=10 height=10 /></span> Symbolic deckbuilding combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3915160/extras/4eb35834743a6a0db6f1db155967acd9.webp?t=1771220444\" width=10 height=10 /></span> Meaningful choices and consequences.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3915160/extras/4eb35834743a6a0db6f1db155967acd9.webp?t=1771220444\" width=10 height=10 /></span> Enemies as emotions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3915160/extras/4eb35834743a6a0db6f1db155967acd9.webp?t=1771220444\" width=10 height=10 /></span> A story that shifts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3915160/extras/4eb35834743a6a0db6f1db155967acd9.webp?t=1771220444\" width=10 height=10 /></span> Stylized art style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3915160/extras/4eb35834743a6a0db6f1db155967acd9.webp?t=1771220444\" width=10 height=10 /></span> Satisfying gameplay mechanics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3915160/extras/4eb35834743a6a0db6f1db155967acd9.webp?t=1771220444\" width=10 height=10 /></span> Endless gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3915160/extras/4eb35834743a6a0db6f1db155967acd9.webp?t=1771220444\" width=10 height=10 /></span> Customizable settings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3915160/extras/4eb35834743a6a0db6f1db155967acd9.webp?t=1771220444\" width=10 height=10 /></span> Variety of unique upgrades and builds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3915160/extras/5c8cbcbfca891634b21f12f566f1a14a.avif?t=1771220444\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3915160/extras_big/5c8cbcbfca891634b21f12f566f1a14a.webp?t=1771220444 width=1560 height=233 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience her life from childhood to adulthood, not as a passive observer, but as an active force shaping her identity. Each battle begins with a conversation between the patient and her therapist, grounding each memory in emotional truth.  As you delve deeper, you uncover traces of something unnatural, a presence twisting her memories for its own ends. What begins as an act of restoration becomes a struggle for identity, truth, and survival. To save her, you’ll have to untangle the moments that defined her life… and confront the darkness that feeds on what she has buried.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3915160/extras/14e14a0da80931bc26f767b583ab9fe4.avif?t=1771220444\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3915160/extras_big/14e14a0da80931bc26f767b583ab9fe4.webp?t=1771220444 width=1560 height=308 /></span><strong